<title>POLAND: PPABank sees 1997 net up to PLN 12.4 mln.</title>
<headline>PPABank sees 1997 net up to PLN 12.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>KRAKOW, Poland 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish bank Pierwszy Polski-Amerykanski Bank SA (PPABank) expects to make a net profit of 12.4 million zlotys this year versus its preliminary figure of nine million for 1996, PPABank's president said.</p>
<p>&quot;Our conservative estimate for this year's net profit is 12.4 million zlotys,&quot; Marek Kulczycki told a news conference late on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In 1995 the bank earned 3.5 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Wojciech Zurawski +48 22 653 9700</p>
